ACORN 1.0 IWML 1.0
Booking.Index
  Title: Book Appointment
  SimpleStack
    Template
      Edit:NameEdit
        Placeholder: Jane Smith
      Edit:PhoneEdit
        Placeholder: +1 555 000 0000
      Edit:EmailEdit
        Placeholder: jane@example.com
      RadioGroup:ServiceGroup =this.Service
        Radio Consultation|Consultation
        Radio Check-up|Check-up
        Radio Procedure|Procedure
        Radio Follow-up|Follow-up
      RadioGroup:TimeGroup =this.TimeSlot
        Radio 9:00 - 10:00|09:00
        Radio 11:00 - 12:00|11:00
        Radio 14:00 - 15:00|14:00
        Radio 16:00 - 17:00|16:00
      EditMulti:NotesEdit
        Height: 80
      Text:SummaryText
      Button:BookButton Book Appointment
      Text:StatusText
